Q: I&#39;m currently attempting to use the MEXC api to check SPOT account info. Is there a reason I keep getting error code 400? A: <p>Use the following pre-script with only <code>recvWindow</code> in the params for the v3 endpoint:</p>
<pre><code>const CryptoJS = require('crypto-js');

const timestamp = pm.environment.get(&quot;timestamp&quot;)
const secret = pm.environment.get(&quot;api_secret&quot;)

const params = `recvWindow=50000&amp;timestamp=${timestamp}`

console.log('params', params)

const signature = CryptoJS.HmacSHA256(params, secret).toString(CryptoJS.enc.Hex)

pm.request.addQueryParams([
    `timestamp=${timestamp}`,
    `signature=${signature}`,
])
</code></pre>

